  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "玛琪艾儿的搭档，\n喵茸的照片。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "739B742A827E513F7684642D6863FF0C000A55B5833876847167724730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "似乎是与玛琪艾儿负责的委托\n相关的文件。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F3C4E4E662F4E0E739B742A827E513F8D1F8D23768459D46258000A76F85173768465874EF630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "或许是因为没怎么用过，\n水槽并不是很脏。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62168BB8662F56E04E3A6CA1600E4E4875288FC7FF0C000A6C3469FD5E764E0D662F5F88810F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看上去很愉快的喵茸\n和穿着西服的男性的照片。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4E0A53BB5F8861095FEB768455B58338000A548C7A7F7740897F670D76847537602776847167724730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看上去很开心的喵茸\n和戴着独特护目镜的男性的照片。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4E0A53BB5F885F005FC3768455B58338000A548C6234774072EC727962A476EE955C76847537602776847167724730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想要在ZA登峰战中获胜的话，\n和对手之间的位置关系至关重要～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F389815728005A0041767B5CF062184E2D83B780DC76848BDDFF0C000A548C5BF9624B4E4B95F476844F4D7F6E51737CFB81F3517391CD8981FF5E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我得到了失控超级进化的信息，\n不过超Z队的各位一定不会有问题吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662115F9752304E86593163A78D857EA78FDB531676844FE1606FFF0C000A4E0D8FC78D85005A961F768454044F4D4E005B9A4E0D4F1A670995EE98985427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "去打听一下有没有人\n知道关于沐净的消息吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53BB6253542C4E004E0B67096CA167094EBA000A77E5905351734E8E6C9051C076846D88606F5427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沐净那件奇事，\n能顺利解决真是太好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9051C090A34EF659474E8BFF0C000A80FD987A522989E351B3771F662F592A597D4E86300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "名为F的人物，\n为什么会和基格尔德10%在一起呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "540D4E3A004676844EBA7269FF0C000A4E3A4EC04E484F1A548C57FA683C5C145FB700310030002557284E008D775462FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你在ZA登峰战的级别\n提升得很顺利。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F605728005A0041767B5CF0621876847EA7522B000A63D053475F975F88987A5229300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你能熟练地使用超级进化了吗？\n那是对抗失控超级进化的有效手段。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而且最重要的是，AZ的愿望是\n找到最强的超级进化训练家嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6080FD719F7EC357304F7F75288D857EA78FDB53164E865417FF1F000A90A3662F5BF96297593163A78D857EA78FDB5316768467096548624B6BB5300200100001BE01000A800C4E14670091CD89817684662FFF0C0041005A7684613F671B662F000A627E523067005F3A76848D857EA78FDB53168BAD7EC35BB6561B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "无论我怎么调查，\n都弄不清楚F这个人的目的……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n亏我还是第二代所长，太丢人了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E08BBA6211600E4E488C0367E5FF0C000A90FD5F044E0D6E05695A00468FD94E2A4EBA768476EE76842026202600100001BE00000A4E8F62118FD8662F7B2C4E8C4EE36240957FFF0C592A4E224EBA4E86300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "棱镜塔的异变……\n无论发生什么事，我也会守护密阿雷的和平。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n因为这是我跟大叔的约定。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "68F1955C585476845F0253D820262026000A65E08BBA53D1751F4EC04E484E8BFF0C62114E5F4F1A5B8862A45BC6963F96F77684548C5E73300200100001BE00000A56E04E3A8FD9662F62118DDF592753D476847EA65B9A300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在密阿雷有很多\n有困难的宝可梦和人哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285BC6963F96F767095F88591A000A670956F096BE76845B9D53EF68A6548C4EBA54E6FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "白板上汇总了和委托相关的\n各种信息。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767D677F4E0A6C47603B4E86548C59D4625876F851737684000A540479CD4FE1606F30020000",
